; the sound scheme and the names of the events, read by PlaySound and MessageBeep, as the default account of the
; 26300.9457 image has them. a program that plays a system sound names an event, the event's .Current value is the file,
; and a value that is empty is an event without a sound. the files are microsoft's, see the genuine manifest.

